## Layouts, shells and navigation

- app: header first; container fluid center, padding 6, section gap 6; header sticky, divider.
- marketing: header first; container fluid center, padding 6, section gap 6, full-bleed sections; header scrolls, over the hero, none.

Component defaults: Textarea look outline; Tag variant base, size sm, look bordered; Tabs variant default; Switch variant default, size sm; MultiSelect look outline; Select look outline; Radio variant default, size sm; PopoverButton look ""; Link variant default, look ""; Input look outline; NumberInput look outline; PasswordInput look outline; SearchInput look outline; FormControl variant default, size sm, look outline; Dialog size md; Chip variant default, size sm, look outline; ChipGroup look ""; Checkbox variant default, size sm; Card variant default, look outline; Button variant default, size md, look ""; IconButton look ""; Avatar size md; Accordion look bordered; Collapsible look bordered; Toast status info.

Navigation: Shelf → S04 (signedIn), Sign in → S02 (public).

### SH1 app

The frame of every framed app page, from the theme's app layout. Frames S04, S06.

- SH1.r1 top, 56 tall, row gap 3 padding 3 align center justify between: start: the wordmark; end: the Shelf link
  - [text heading] Shelf \`SH1.n01\`
  - [Button sm ghost · navigation] Shelf → S04 (72 wide; over the defaults: Navigation in the top bar reads as a link, not a call to action.) \`SH1.n02\`

### SH2 marketing

The frame of every framed marketing page, from the theme's marketing layout. Frames S01.

- SH2.r1 top, over the page, 64 tall, row gap 4 padding 4 align center justify between: start: the wordmark; end: Sign in
  - [text heading] Shelf \`SH2.n01\`
  - [Button sm ghost · navigation] Sign in → S02 (over the defaults: Navigation in the top bar reads as a link, not a call to action.) \`SH2.n02\`

## S01 Shelf

